    <briefdescription>
<para>A transition that reveals items one after another, in index order. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>As an <computeroutput>enterTransition</computeroutput> it draws the added items in; as an <computeroutput>exitTransition</computeroutput> it hides the removed items from the last to the first. A line draws its last revealed segment partway.</para>
<para><computeroutput>stagger</computeroutput> defaults to 1: each item appears at once, and <computeroutput>easing</computeroutput> shapes how the reveal moves along the items. An opacity animation fades each item in from the moment the reveal reaches it:</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".qml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">QAccelPlot.DrawTransition<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NumberAnimation<sp/>{<sp/>property:<sp/>&quot;opacity&quot;;<sp/>from:<sp/>0;<sp/>duration:<sp/>250<sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1GrowTransition" kindref="compound">GrowTransition</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1MorphTransition" kindref="compound">MorphTransition</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1EnterExitTransition" kindref="compound">EnterExitTransition</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
